      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How fast can I get custom apparel or promotional products?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "SLDivPrint specializes in 24-48 hour rush printing for custom apparel, hoodies, tees, tote bags, water bottles, and thousands of promo items. Many items have low or zero minimums. Contact us for an instant quote."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do you offer same-day or next-day step and repeat banners for trade shows?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. We have delivered full step and repeat banner setups and retractable banners same-day or within 24 hours for emergency trade show needs across the US, including New York and major events like Coachella."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What printing methods do you use for custom apparel?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "We offer Screen Printing (great for bulk, vibrant colors), Embroidery (premium textured look, durable for polos/caps), and DTG (Direct-to-Garment) for full-color detailed designs on small runs or single items."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can you handle order fulfillment and warehousing for my branded merchandise?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. We provide secure warehousing, kitting, pick-pack-ship, e-commerce integration (Shopify/Amazon), live tracking, and nationwide fulfillment with 99% accuracy. Perfect for brands scaling events or subscription boxes."
